until I had a chance to figure it out myself .

257
00:16:44,747 --> 00:16:47,672
But the angel said I had to do it now .

258
00:16:48,832 --> 00:16:50,379
Fenton ?

259
00:16:51,832 --> 00:16:54,072
FENTON 'S VOICE : I didn 't know what to say or how to feel .

260
00:16:54,313 --> 00:16:56,178
Do you understand what I told you ?

261
00:16:57,512 --> 00:16:58,752
The Judgment Day 's here .

262
00:16:59,066 --> 00:17:01,000
It was too messed up to understand

263
00:17:01,152 --> 00:17:02,454
or even acknowledge .

264
00:17:02,523 --> 00:17:04,252
Soon we 'll all be in Heaven .

265
00:17:05,034 --> 00:17:06,968
You , me , Adam , with Mommy .

266
00:17:07,312 --> 00:17:09,027
I didn 't realize it at that moment ...

267
00:17:09,105 --> 00:17:11,740
- At least , not consciously ... - She 's waiting to see us in Heaven .

268
00:17:11,809 --> 00:17:15,768
But my happy and mostly secure world had just been flipped over

269
00:17:15,910 --> 00:17:17,537
and there were dark things under there .

270
00:17:18,352 --> 00:17:20,275
- Judgment Day is here . - Very dark things .

271
00:17:20,752 --> 00:17:22,715
We 've been chosen by God .

272
00:17:22,785 --> 00:17:24,980
And my little boy 's mind just couldn 't take it .

273
00:17:32,072 --> 00:17:34,726
DAD : Adam ! Fenton !

274
00:17:37,632 --> 00:17:39,867
Up and at ' em , boys !

275
00:17:49,178 --> 00:17:52,305
Morning , kiddo . Come on , lazybones .

276
00:17:52,380 --> 00:17:53,511
It 's late , we overslept .

277
00:17:57,231 --> 00:17:59,853
Let 's go ! Snap to it and get dressed . I 've got to get to work .

278
00:18:00,151 --> 00:18:02,253
I 'll drop you guys off on the way .

279
00:18:04,065 --> 00:18:05,311
What 's wrong with you ?

280
00:18:09,071 --> 00:18:10,081
Nothing .

281
00:18:23,545 --> 00:18:27,345
Radio : â  ª She still blames me ... â  ª

282
00:18:27,431 --> 00:18:29,365
Let me have a bite of that .

283
00:18:29,434 --> 00:18:31,129
â  ª Her dreams are gone. â  ª

284
00:18:31,259 --> 00:18:32,819
Fenton 's voice : None of us mentioned it .

285
00:18:33,626 --> 00:18:35,992
It was only a dream ... A nightmare .

286
00:18:39,461 --> 00:18:41,151
Nothing that crazy could be real .

287
00:18:42,671 --> 00:18:45,224
Everything was okay , just like before .

288
00:18:51,439 --> 00:18:52,991
Have a good day at school , boys .

289
00:18:53,991 --> 00:18:56,150
And remember not to tell anyone what I told you last night !

290
00:18:56,219 --> 00:18:57,272
We won 't Dad , bye !

291
00:19:07,354 --> 00:19:09,185
( SCHOOL BELL RINGS )

292
00:19:09,510 --> 00:19:11,816
TEACHER : I want you all to copy down this sentence .

293
00:19:11,892 --> 00:19:14,360
We 're going to go through the structure . " The girl ... "

294
00:19:16,510 --> 00:19:17,886
" in ... the blue dress ... "

295
00:19:20,391 --> 00:19:22,586
Fenton 's voice : I refused to believe it .

296
00:19:23,590 --> 00:19:26,167
That whole next week was just a dream too .

297
00:19:28,208 --> 00:19:29,641
TEACHER : " walked her ... "

298
00:19:30,310 --> 00:19:31,473
brown dog . "

299
00:19:31,950 --> 00:19:33,910
Like when Dad started bringing home

300
00:19:34,075 --> 00:19:36,043
the magical weapons .

301
00:19:38,030 --> 00:19:39,945
He was on his way to work ...

302
00:19:41,288 --> 00:19:42,470
When God called to him .

303
00:19:43,457 --> 00:19:45,982
( COUNTRY MUSIC ON RADIO )

304
00:20:28,267 --> 00:20:30,735
DAD : Hold this , be careful .

305
00:20:33,109 --> 00:20:35,965
I still can 't understand what these gloves are for , though .

306
00:20:41,957 --> 00:20:44,051
Fenton 's voice : Just a long , long dream .

307
00:20:44,120 --> 00:20:46,645
TEACHER : Write this down in big letters ...

308
00:20:50,123 --> 00:20:51,749
DAD : Boys ! Boys !

309
00:20:51,992 --> 00:20:53,269
Look at this .

310
00:21:00,767 --> 00:21:01,909
We 've got them all .

311
00:21:03,269 --> 00:21:04,509
It won 't be long now .

312
00:21:05,109 --> 00:21:07,149
The angel came again last night and told me that .

313
00:21:07,540 --> 00:21:10,805
God will be sending us a list of the first seven demons soon .

314
00:21:11,629 --> 00:21:13,710
Fenton 's voice : It wasn 't real . It couldn 't be .

315
00:21:14,469 --> 00:21:16,146
I just had to wait it out .

316
00:21:22,005 --> 00:21:23,492
Come over here a minute , Fenton .

317
00:21:23,561 --> 00:21:25,791
- I 'm washing dishes . - They can wait .

318
00:21:26,629 --> 00:21:28,517
Come here . I want to talk to you .

319
00:21:42,828 --> 00:21:44,209
I know you 've had some trouble ...

320
00:21:44,788 --> 00:21:46,748
Adjusting to everything that 's happened this week .

321
00:21:47,112 --> 00:21:48,704
I 'm sorry .

322
00:21:49,028 --> 00:21:51,908
But God has willed this and we must obey God .

323
00:21:54,228 --> 00:21:56,217
Maybe you just dreamed it .

324
00:21:56,501 --> 00:21:57,872
I didn 't dream it .

325
00:21:58,948 --> 00:22:00,988
I wouldn 't make up something like that , son .

326
00:22:03,468 --> 00:22:05,388
Maybe ...

327
00:22:08,348 --> 00:22:11,231
May ... maybe you 're not right in the head .

328
00:22:12,228 --> 00:22:13,238
It happened , Fenton .

329
00:22:13,639 --> 00:22:15,068
It 's true .

330
00:22:15,674 --> 00:22:16,684
You 'll see that soon .

331
00:22:17,676 --> 00:22:19,871
That 's what I wanted to talk to you about .

332
00:22:21,228 --> 00:22:22,539
I got the first list .

333
00:22:25,748 --> 00:22:28,069
FENTON 'S VOICE : The angel came to him while he was at work .

334
00:23:08,326 --> 00:23:10,021
( FIRE CRACKLING )

335
00:23:16,427 --> 00:23:18,547
( SANDER GRINDING )

336
00:23:19,237 --> 00:23:21,203
( PA ANNOUNCEMENTS )

337
00:23:21,272 --> 00:23:22,967
( FLAMES ROARING )

338
00:23:41,307 --> 00:23:42,317
Dad ...

339
00:23:43,267 --> 00:23:45,085
these are people 's names .

340
00:23:45,162 --> 00:23:46,172
That 's right .

341
00:23:46,612 --> 00:23:48,546
And they 'll look like people too .

342
00:23:48,947 --> 00:23:50,427
But they 're not .

343
00:23:52,627 --> 00:23:55,167
The angel said when I lay my hands on them ,

344
00:23:56,107 --> 00:23:57,907
I 'll reveal them for what they truly are .

345
00:23:58,747 --> 00:24:00,267
That 's what the gloves are for .

346
00:24:00,645 --> 00:24:03,205
I get them and bring them back here with the gloves on ,

347
00:24:03,587 --> 00:24:06,341
and once they 're back here , I take the gloves off and reveal them .

348
00:24:08,266 --> 00:24:10,910
You 'll see , then you 'll believe .

349
00:24:12,022 --> 00:24:14,547
TEACHER : Does anyone know what this word means ?

350
00:24:15,066 --> 00:24:16,922
FENTON 'S VOICE : The dream had finally ended .

351
00:24:17,786 --> 00:24:18,927
It was all real .

352
00:24:20,030 --> 00:24:21,930
( YELLS )

353
00:24:23,509 --> 00:24:24,863
And I had to stop him .

354
00:24:27,306 --> 00:24:30,200
The obvious answer was to tell somebody what he was planning .

355
00:24:30,906 --> 00:24:32,332
But I couldn 't do that .

356
00:24:33,786 --> 00:24:36,537
I loved him , even if he had gone crazy .

357
00:24:36,906 --> 00:24:38,911
Dad , look , I got a list too .

358
00:24:40,906 --> 00:24:42,285
Where 'd you get this , Adam ?

359
00:24:42,386 --> 00:24:43,876
God gave it to me .

360
00:24:47,626 --> 00:24:50,420
Isn 't Travis Shed that boy who was picking on you last week ?

361
00:24:51,106 --> 00:24:52,116
He 's a demon .

362
00:24:53,866 --> 00:24:54,986
Tell the truth , Adam .

363
00:24:55,899 --> 00:24:57,764
You made this list up yourself , didn 't you ?

364
00:24:58,146 --> 00:24:59,893
- No , God did . - Adam .

365
00:25:02,306 --> 00:25:03,736
Come on , right here .

366
00:25:05,342 --> 00:25:07,242
Listen to me , son ,

367
00:25:07,706 --> 00:25:09,574
you can 't just make stuff like that up .

368
00:25:10,306 --> 00:25:11,807
We destroy demons .

369
00:25:11,881 --> 00:25:14,406
If we were to use your list , we wouldn 't be destroying demons ,

370
00:25:14,484 --> 00:25:16,088
we 'd be killing people .

371
00:25:16,157 --> 00:25:17,310
And we can never do that .

372
00:25:18,421 --> 00:25:20,446
Destroying demons is a good thing .

373
00:25:20,523 --> 00:25:22,705
Killing people is bad . Do you understand ?

374
00:25:23,665 --> 00:25:26,252
- I 'm sorry , Dad . - That 's all right .

375
00:25:26,452 --> 00:25:28,884
It 's okay . You 've just got to have a little patience .

376
00:25:30,065 --> 00:25:33,563
Don 't worry , God will send you your own list when you 're older .

377
00:25:34,625 --> 00:25:36,035
Okay , go do some homework .

378
00:25:46,865 --> 00:25:49,442
FENTON 'S VOICE : The only thing left to do was to tell .

379
00:25:55,145 --> 00:25:57,123
That was easier said than done .

380
00:26:14,105 --> 00:26:16,973
Dad had promised to take us to the movies that night .

381
00:26:19,745 --> 00:26:21,715
But he didn 't come home from work .

382
00:26:23,425 --> 00:26:24,883
When 's Dad coming home ?

383
00:26:25,145 --> 00:26:26,155
I don 't know .

384
00:26:28,865 --> 00:26:30,545
Think he 's destroying a demon ?

385
00:26:30,993 --> 00:26:33,928
- It 's all make-believe , Adam . - No , it 's not , it 's true !

386
00:26:34,745 --> 00:26:36,367
Listen to me , none of that demon junk is real .

387
00:26:36,436 --> 00:26:38,460
Daddy ... he just made it up .

388
00:26:39,504 --> 00:26:41,744
- No , he didn 't . - He did too .

389
00:26:42,092 --> 00:26:43,923
Just like Santa Claus .

390
00:26:44,544 --> 00:26:46,402
You remember last Christmas when you caught Dad

391
00:26:46,474 --> 00:26:48,999
putting our presents under the tree , don 't you ?

392
00:26:49,824 --> 00:26:51,704
It 's just like that .

393
00:26:52,504 --> 00:26:54,509
Adam , have I ever lied to you ?

394
00:26:56,904 --> 00:26:59,545
All right , look , Dad made up this whole thing .

395
00:26:59,877 --> 00:27:02,180
Those names on Dad 's list are real people .

396
00:27:02,864 --> 00:27:04,588
Do you understand ?

397
00:27:04,784 --> 00:27:06,058
But , why would he make it up ?

398
00:27:06,184 --> 00:27:07,560
I don 't know .

399
00:27:08,744 --> 00:27:10,860
I think we should leave .

400
00:27:11,304 --> 00:27:13,662
You mean ... run away ?

401
00:27:14,704 --> 00:27:17,170
Will you go with me ? Only for a little while .

402
00:27:17,784 --> 00:27:19,604
I don 't want to leave Dad .

403
00:27:19,784 --> 00:27:21,704
Neither do I.

404
00:27:22,744 --> 00:27:24,476
But we might have to .

405
00:27:24,904 --> 00:27:25,914
Why ?

406
00:27:31,344 --> 00:27:33,011
Dad 's gonna kill somebody .

407
00:27:54,623 --> 00:27:56,766
( CAR APPROACHING )

408
00:28:06,143 --> 00:28:08,983
( ENGINE STOPS , DOOR SHUTS )

409
00:28:38,983 --> 00:28:40,311
Son , come over here .

410
00:28:42,543 --> 00:28:44,424
- ( MUFFLED CRIES ) - Come on , I need your help .

411
00:29:07,980 --> 00:29:10,062
ADAM : Dad ?

412
00:29:10,282 --> 00:29:11,382
Come on out here , Adam .

413
00:29:17,862 --> 00:29:19,888
Shine that light over here .

414
00:29:21,262 --> 00:29:22,272
( STRIKES MATCH )

415
00:29:22,862 --> 00:29:24,990
ADAM : Hey , Dad , who is that ?

416
00:29:25,622 --> 00:29:27,191
That 's a demon , son .

417
00:29:30,662 --> 00:29:33,096
Come on in here , boys . It 's all right .

418
00:29:33,622 --> 00:29:35,902
Go on , don 't be afraid .

419
00:29:55,582 --> 00:29:57,193
FENTON 'S VOICE : God came to him earlier that day

420
00:29:57,262 --> 00:29:59,025
and told him that the time had come .

421
00:30:02,462 --> 00:30:04,798
After work , he drove down to Jacksonville ,

422
00:30:05,002 --> 00:30:07,203
about 45 minutes or so southwest of Thurman .

423
00:30:09,222 --> 00:30:10,513
He said he 'd never been there before ,

424
00:30:10,582 --> 00:30:12,575
but he had no problem finding it .

425
00:30:13,479 --> 00:30:14,509
God was leading him .

426
00:30:44,942 --> 00:30:48,173
- Cynthia Harbridge ? - Yes ?

427
00:31:00,701 --> 00:31:02,788
Dad , don 't . Please don 't .

428
00:31:04,421 --> 00:31:06,352
Fenton , if I could spare you this , I would .

429
00:31:08,421 --> 00:31:09,933
But we are God 's servants ,

430
00:31:10,021 --> 00:31:11,992
and his will must be served .

431
00:31:16,261 --> 00:31:17,906
Don 't be afraid , son .

432
00:31:25,741 --> 00:31:27,378
( MUFFLED CRIES )

433
00:31:33,624 --> 00:31:36,354
( ROLLING THUNDER )

434
00:31:41,860 --> 00:31:43,131
Is that true ?

435
00:31:44,540 --> 00:31:46,202
Why would I make it up ?

436
00:31:47,860 --> 00:31:49,397
Where 's your father now ?

437
00:31:51,180 --> 00:31:52,608
Dead .

438
00:31:54,580 --> 00:31:56,609
Sir , I was thinking about heading out .

439
00:31:57,180 --> 00:31:59,148
Unless you need me to stay .

440
00:31:59,534 --> 00:32:00,687
No ...

441
00:32:01,980 --> 00:32:03,678
that 's all right . You go ahead .

442
00:32:04,300 --> 00:32:05,619
Have a good night , sir .

443
00:32:15,380 --> 00:32:17,693
So he killed that woman right there in front of you ?

444
00:32:18,487 --> 00:32:20,421
Maybe not to his way of thinking .

445
00:32:22,260 --> 00:32:24,598
See , to him , he hadn 't killed a woman ,

446
00:32:24,674 --> 00:32:26,780
he had destroyed a demon .

447
00:32:28,180 --> 00:32:30,935
He believed that when he laid his hands on her ,

448
00:32:31,380 --> 00:32:33,482
it revealed her sins .

449
00:32:51,420 --> 00:32:52,898
( SCREAMS )

450
00:32:54,203 --> 00:32:55,693
( GASPS )

451
00:33:21,259 --> 00:33:22,269
( GASPS )

452
00:33:22,619 --> 00:33:24,257
( PANTING )

453
00:33:29,471 --> 00:33:31,666
FENTON : Dad , don 't , please !

454
00:33:41,339 --> 00:33:43,277
( CRICKETS CHIRPING )

455
00:34:05,299 --> 00:34:07,404
( FENTON CRYING )

456
00:34:19,618 --> 00:34:20,628
DAD : No , Adam .

457
00:34:24,938 --> 00:34:26,884
Do it like this .

458
00:34:29,978 --> 00:34:31,997
It 's got to be done a certain way .

459
00:34:32,066 --> 00:34:34,033
The angel was real specific .

460
00:34:34,102 --> 00:34:36,298
ADAM : Why out here in the rose garden ?

461
00:34:37,138 --> 00:34:38,695
God chose it .

462
00:34:39,138 --> 00:34:40,968
Just like he chose us , I suppose .

463
00:34:44,418 --> 00:34:46,312
Don 't cry for her , Fenton .

464
00:34:46,381 --> 00:34:48,058
She wasn 't human .

465
00:34:49,418 --> 00:34:51,451
Didn 't you see that when I touched her ?

466
00:34:51,538 --> 00:34:53,578
- ( SNIFFS ) - ADAM : I saw it , Dad .

467
00:34:58,693 --> 00:35:00,018
You killed her .

468
00:35:01,498 --> 00:35:02,818
I didn 't kill her , son .

469
00:35:03,298 --> 00:35:05,528
I destroyed her . She was a demon .

470
00:35:08,978 --> 00:35:11,570
I wasn 't so sure I could do it , myself .

471
00:35:11,639 --> 00:35:13,800
I mean , she looked like a woman to me too .

472
00:35:14,378 --> 00:35:16,343
But after I touched her ...

473
00:35:17,378 --> 00:35:19,471
All I could see was the evil ,

474
00:35:19,978 --> 00:35:21,640
and I had to do it .

475
00:35:23,617 --> 00:35:25,641
I 'm sorry you didn 't see it too .

476
00:35:26,777 --> 00:35:28,517
You will next time .

477
00:35:28,737 --> 00:35:30,681
You ... you 're going to do it again ?

478
00:35:33,337 --> 00:35:35,091
This is our job now , son .

479
00:35:36,017 --> 00:35:38,962
- You 've got to accept that . - I won 't let you .

480
00:35:40,217 --> 00:35:41,988
You can 't stop it . We are doing God 's ...

481
00:35:42,057 --> 00:35:43,097
I 'll tell .

482
00:35:44,737 --> 00:35:46,768
If you do , someone will die .

483
00:35:46,840 --> 00:35:49,104
The angel was clear on that . Do you understand ?

484
00:35:50,777 --> 00:35:53,112
Answer me , Fenton , do you understand ?

485
00:35:57,177 --> 00:35:59,084
DOYLE : So you didn 't tell ?

486
00:36:00,097 --> 00:36:02,349
Naw , I should have , but I was afraid .

487
00:36:03,457 --> 00:36:06,051
I loved my father , but I was terrified of him .

488
00:36:07,697 --> 00:36:09,355
So now you understand why I know

489
00:36:09,424 --> 00:36:11,223
my brother 's the God 's hand killer ?

490
00:36:11,937 --> 00:36:13,658
Have you got any physical proof ?

491
00:36:15,168 --> 00:36:17,102
I read in the paper ...

492
00:36:18,017 --> 00:36:20,162
that only one of the bodies of the six victims

493
00:36:20,240 --> 00:36:22,071
had been found . Is that true ?

494
00:36:23,057 --> 00:36:24,975
You read it in the paper , didn 't you ?

495
00:36:25,045 --> 00:36:26,777
That doesn 't necessarily mean it 's true .

496
00:36:26,994 --> 00:36:29,155
Well , in this case it does .

497
00:36:29,491 --> 00:36:32,777
See , the first victim was found ... mutilated .

498
00:36:33,820 --> 00:36:36,057
With a note saying that God 's hand had taken him .

499
00:36:37,617 --> 00:36:39,649
All the rest , only notes were found , no bodies .

500
00:36:40,696 --> 00:36:41,920
How do you know they 're dead ?

501
00:36:42,616 --> 00:36:43,757
We don 't , for sure .

502
00:36:44,416 --> 00:36:46,518
But the first note told us

503
00:36:46,587 --> 00:36:48,769
we wouldn 't find any more bodies from then on .

504
00:36:49,268 --> 00:36:52,704
Said ... he wanted to keep ' em .

505
00:36:54,896 --> 00:36:57,701
I got a pretty good idea where the rest of them bodies are .

506
00:36:59,576 --> 00:37:01,303
The rose garden .

507
00:37:03,682 --> 00:37:06,116
Why didn 't you tell me that in the first place ?

508
00:37:07,296 --> 00:37:08,483
Would you believe me ?

509
00:37:11,176 --> 00:37:12,420
Come on .

510
00:37:28,336 --> 00:37:29,346
Here .

511
00:37:32,536 --> 00:37:33,574
What 's this ?

512
00:37:34,936 --> 00:37:36,340
Put ' em on .

513
00:37:37,056 --> 00:37:38,713
Or I 'll put them on for you .

514
00:37:49,696 --> 00:37:50,706
Let 's go .

515
00:38:06,855 --> 00:38:08,074
I got it .

516
00:38:31,975 --> 00:38:33,175
