00:57:31,353 --> 00:57:33,058
Don 't break my door down .

773
00:57:33,681 --> 00:57:35,144
What 's your problem ?

774
00:57:36,712 --> 00:57:38,737
Craziest thing I 've heard in a long time .

775
00:57:38,814 --> 00:57:40,873
- What are you doing ? - Calling your dad .

776
00:57:40,949 --> 00:57:42,541
- You can 't ! - Yes , I can .

777
00:57:42,618 --> 00:57:44,342
You ought to be ashamed making up stories like that .

778
00:57:44,411 --> 00:57:46,962
But ... but it 's true ! I can show you !

779
00:57:51,960 --> 00:57:54,158
Come on . Let 's go .

780
00:58:08,075 --> 00:58:10,635
All right , it 's around back , under the shed .

781
00:58:10,711 --> 00:58:12,269
That 's enough of that now , boy .

782
00:58:12,759 --> 00:58:14,101
I 'll put an end to this . Come on .

783
00:58:14,170 --> 00:58:16,638
N-N-No , I don 't think you understand . He 's around back .

784
00:58:17,285 --> 00:58:19,879
See what your Dad 's got to say about all this .

785
00:58:28,602 --> 00:58:30,365
What 's the trouble , Sheriff ?

786
00:58:32,466 --> 00:58:35,196
Sorry to wake you , but your boy here seems to have a problem .

787
00:58:40,479 --> 00:58:42,101
Well , come on in .

788
00:58:53,600 --> 00:58:56,608
SHERIFF : I was about to lock up , head over to Lake Thompson .

789
00:58:56,677 --> 00:58:58,702
You know , get a jump on those bass .

790
00:58:59,226 --> 00:59:02,286
And he comes running in with this wild story .

791
00:59:02,759 --> 00:59:04,888
Yep , it 's quite a tale , all right .

792
00:59:04,966 --> 00:59:06,831
It 's the truth and you know it .

793
00:59:08,903 --> 00:59:11,427
It makes me crazy to think that he ...

794
00:59:11,504 --> 00:59:13,758
Told everyone down at your office too .

795
00:59:13,848 --> 00:59:15,991
You can set your mind at ease about that .

796
00:59:16,060 --> 00:59:17,598
I was the only one there .

797
00:59:18,072 --> 00:59:20,267
' Course I don 't believe a word of it .

798
00:59:21,478 --> 00:59:23,212
What does get me though is why

799
00:59:23,283 --> 00:59:25,342
would he make up such a crazy story ?

800
00:59:28,718 --> 00:59:30,889
I don 't know why he made it up .

801
00:59:32,758 --> 00:59:35,121
Probably did it to get back at me

802
00:59:35,195 --> 00:59:36,638
for punishing him earlier .

803
00:59:37,678 --> 00:59:39,122
Did you tell him about that ?

804
00:59:39,318 --> 00:59:41,690
He 's lying . Just check the shed .

805
00:59:44,371 --> 00:59:46,498
I don 't know what to do with him .

806
00:59:47,118 --> 00:59:48,734
Well , they hit puberty ,

807
00:59:48,808 --> 00:59:51,038
seem to lose all respect for ya .

808
00:59:51,918 --> 00:59:54,478
Me and my boys survived it , you will too .

809
00:59:55,061 --> 00:59:57,705
Just check the shed ... Or the rose garden .

810
00:59:57,774 --> 00:59:59,969
I-I-I could show you where they 're buried .

811
01:00:00,082 --> 01:00:03,313
Boy , why don 't you just quit all this nonsense ?

812
01:00:03,424 --> 01:00:05,517
Please , I can show you .

813
01:00:11,131 --> 01:00:13,752
Maybe we ought to check the shed , just to ...

814
01:00:13,821 --> 01:00:15,152
quiet him down .

815
01:00:16,278 --> 01:00:17,500
If it has to be done ,

816
01:00:17,569 --> 01:00:19,318
it has to be done .

817
01:00:20,943 --> 01:00:22,043
What do you think , kiddo ?

818
01:00:24,918 --> 01:00:26,907
Does it have to be done ?

819
01:00:43,357 --> 01:00:44,367
FENTON : See ?

820
01:00:45,757 --> 01:00:47,698
I figured we ought to have a storm cellar .

821
01:00:48,437 --> 01:00:49,791
Go on down and check it out .

822
01:00:50,237 --> 01:00:52,564
Just watch your step , I 'm not much of a carpenter .

823
01:01:21,757 --> 01:01:23,361
I don 't see a thing .

824
01:01:24,837 --> 01:01:26,399
He was here .

825
01:01:26,568 --> 01:01:28,405
Boy ... do you realize

826
01:01:28,474 --> 01:01:31,443
how much trouble you could get into over a thing like this ?

827
01:01:32,232 --> 01:01:34,723
They must have moved him because he was here .

828
01:01:35,837 --> 01:01:38,675
Adam ! Adam 's got him somewhere , I know it .

829
01:01:39,677 --> 01:01:41,218
I think I 've seen enough .

830
01:01:41,716 --> 01:01:42,843
But ...

831
01:01:43,356 --> 01:01:45,150
I can show you where the bodies are buried .

832
01:01:54,156 --> 01:01:56,694
Please , you 've got to believe me !

833
01:01:56,796 --> 01:01:58,895
- ( AX THUDS ) - ( SHERIFF GRUNTS )

834
01:02:22,596 --> 01:02:24,590
( GASPS )

835
01:02:27,516 --> 01:02:29,225
May God welcome you .

836
01:02:30,434 --> 01:02:32,299
And keep you .

837
01:02:37,408 --> 01:02:39,433
( VOMITING )

838
01:02:44,148 --> 01:02:46,048
( PLASTIC RUSTLES )

839
01:02:51,676 --> 01:02:54,016
I never killed a man before tonight .

840
01:02:55,092 --> 01:02:56,718
I 've seen you kill plenty .

841
01:02:57,955 --> 01:02:59,387
Those were demons !

842
01:02:59,555 --> 01:03:02,056
That was a man . Why can 't you see that ?

843
01:03:02,515 --> 01:03:05,533
- You didn 't have to kill him . - I had to protect our mission .

844
01:03:05,602 --> 01:03:07,627
There is no mission !

845
01:03:07,704 --> 01:03:10,235
That man is dead because of you !

846
01:03:10,508 --> 01:03:12,032
You see him ? Look at him !

847
01:03:12,835 --> 01:03:15,206
He 's dead because you have no faith .

848
01:03:15,715 --> 01:03:17,678
Do you understand what you made me do ?

849
01:03:17,747 --> 01:03:20,595
- You made me commit murder ! - I didn 't make you do anything !

850
01:03:20,945 --> 01:03:23,675
- You did ! You 're crazy ! - ( YELLS )

851
01:03:24,068 --> 01:03:25,501
ADAM : Dad , no !

852
01:03:25,767 --> 01:03:27,257
Dad , don 't !

853
01:03:30,227 --> 01:03:31,956
( DAD GROANS )

854
01:03:34,035 --> 01:03:35,893
( DAD CRYING )

855
01:03:37,200 --> 01:03:38,737
It 's all right , Dad .

856
01:03:38,806 --> 01:03:39,875
Don 't cry .

857
01:04:05,795 --> 01:04:07,693
Wait a minute , Fenton .

858
01:04:08,475 --> 01:04:09,635
Go on inside , son .

859
01:04:09,907 --> 01:04:11,507
I 'll be there in a minute to tuck you in .

860
01:04:12,514 --> 01:04:13,524
Go on , it 's all right .

861
01:04:13,955 --> 01:04:14,965
Go .

862
01:04:21,234 --> 01:04:22,977
Come into the shed .

863
01:04:39,354 --> 01:04:41,326
Come in and shut the door .

864
01:04:51,274 --> 01:04:52,670
Are you afraid ?

865
01:04:53,776 --> 01:04:56,210
- Of what ? - Y-you .

866
01:04:57,780 --> 01:04:59,975
Only demons should fear me .

867
01:05:01,183 --> 01:05:03,310
You 're not a demon , are you ?

868
01:05:05,394 --> 01:05:07,084
The angel said you were .

869
01:05:10,034 --> 01:05:11,884
I can 't believe that .

870
01:05:11,961 --> 01:05:13,656
I won 't .

871
01:05:16,748 --> 01:05:18,184
You 're my son .

872
01:05:18,834 --> 01:05:21,302
I love you more than my own life .

873
01:05:24,311 --> 01:05:26,744
You know what 's funny about all this , Fenton ?

874
01:05:29,344 --> 01:05:30,593
I 'm afraid of you .

875
01:05:45,898 --> 01:05:47,388
( WHIMPERS )

876
01:05:54,873 --> 01:05:56,193
Go on .

877
01:05:57,605 --> 01:05:59,800
- But , Dad ... - Go on , get down there .

878
01:05:59,874 --> 01:06:02,365
I don 't want to do this , Fenton , but I have to .

879
01:06:02,443 --> 01:06:04,502
I had to kill a man tonight .

880
01:06:05,153 --> 01:06:06,672
I can 't let that happen again .

881
01:06:06,953 --> 01:06:09,181
But , Dad , I promise I won 't tell .

882
01:06:09,250 --> 01:06:10,273
I can 't trust you !

883
01:06:10,952 --> 01:06:12,793
I wish I could .

884
01:06:12,959 --> 01:06:16,360
- Now , go on . - But , Dad ... I 'm sorry .

885
01:06:17,825 --> 01:06:19,273
I 'm sorry , too , Fenton ,

886
01:06:19,684 --> 01:06:21,618
but this has to be done .

887
01:06:22,153 --> 01:06:23,513
Now , you get on down there ,

888
01:06:23,962 --> 01:06:26,071
or I 'll put you down there myself .

889
01:06:26,140 --> 01:06:27,368
- But , Dad ... - Go !

890
01:06:28,903 --> 01:06:29,993
No ...

891
01:06:31,839 --> 01:06:34,000
No ! No !

892
01:06:34,075 --> 01:06:36,305
- No ... - ( GRUNTING )

893
01:06:37,812 --> 01:06:39,778
Dad , please , Dad , Dad ...

894
01:06:39,847 --> 01:06:41,404
No , please , no !

895
01:06:41,481 --> 01:06:43,244
Please , Dad ...

896
01:06:43,316 --> 01:06:45,648
You 'll stay down here until you see the truth .

897
01:06:45,719 --> 01:06:47,448
Please ! Dad , no !

898
01:06:47,521 --> 01:06:49,489
- Please ! - Pray to God , Fenton .

899
01:06:49,792 --> 01:06:51,522
- Dad , no ! Please ! - Pray for a vision .

900
01:06:51,591 --> 01:06:53,855
- No ! No ! - Only he can help you now .

901
01:06:53,927 --> 01:06:56,623
Please , don 't do this , Dad .

902
01:06:56,832 --> 01:06:59,995
Please ! Please ! It 's me , Fenton !

903
01:07:00,272 --> 01:07:02,365
Please don 't do this !

904
01:07:04,312 --> 01:07:05,769
It 's me !

905
01:07:06,232 --> 01:07:08,381
I 'm not a demon , please !

906
01:07:08,450 --> 01:07:10,112
Please , it 's me !

907
01:07:16,616 --> 01:07:18,584
Please , don 't do this .

908
01:07:19,318 --> 01:07:20,946
No ! Don 't !

909
01:07:24,832 --> 01:07:27,026
( SHED DOOR OPENS , SHUTS )

910
01:07:35,068 --> 01:07:37,059
( DOOR OPENS )

911
01:07:41,208 --> 01:07:42,607
Fenton ?

912
01:07:44,032 --> 01:07:45,468
Fenton ?

913
01:07:47,552 --> 01:07:49,178
Fenton , you all right ?

914
01:07:50,192 --> 01:07:51,649
Adam ?

915
01:07:52,392 --> 01:07:54,050
Adam , is that you ?

916
01:07:59,631 --> 01:08:00,754
Adam .

917
01:08:01,591 --> 01:08:03,391
Adam , you got to get me out of here .

918
01:08:03,748 --> 01:08:06,046
- I can 't . - But I 'm hungry .

919
01:08:06,391 --> 01:08:08,664
And I gotta go to the bathroom .

920
01:08:08,734 --> 01:08:10,634
Dad won 't let me feed you .

921
01:08:11,031 --> 01:08:12,694
I brought you some water though .

922
01:08:13,031 --> 01:08:15,205
He says you can have a cup a day ...

923
01:08:15,274 --> 01:08:16,991
But I 'll bring you more if I can .

924
01:08:17,671 --> 01:08:20,071
Look , Adam , he 's gonna kill me .

925
01:08:20,431 --> 01:08:21,831
You 've got to get me out of here .

926
01:08:22,127 --> 01:08:25,290
I can 't . Put your mouth to the knothole right here .

927
01:08:27,831 --> 01:08:29,213
- You ready ? - Uh-huh .

928
01:08:29,282 --> 01:08:30,510
Here .

929
01:08:40,271 --> 01:08:43,093
You want some more or you want me to save it for later ?

930
01:08:43,751 --> 01:08:45,694
More . More !

931
01:08:56,751 --> 01:08:58,612
You 've got to get me out of here , Adam .

932
01:08:58,911 --> 01:09:01,471
Dad says you 'll probably be out of there by the end of the week .

933
01:09:02,071 --> 01:09:04,186
You just have to accept God 's will .

934
01:09:04,471 --> 01:09:07,521
A week ? I can 't stay in here that long .

935
01:09:07,593 --> 01:09:08,603
I 'll pray for you .

936
01:09:09,471 --> 01:09:10,733
Adam ... ?

937
01:09:10,802 --> 01:09:12,692
- Adam ! - ( DOOR SHUTS )

938
01:09:12,761 --> 01:09:14,888
( POUNDING )

939
01:09:15,790 --> 01:09:18,160
( SCREAMING )

940
01:09:20,870 --> 01:09:22,234
Adam ?

941
01:09:25,670 --> 01:09:27,830
Fenton 's voice : The days came and went .

942
01:09:29,390 --> 01:09:32,743
I counted them by the cracks of light through the hatch door ,

943
01:09:32,817 --> 01:09:34,751
and Adam 's visits with the water .

944
01:09:35,630 --> 01:09:38,311
I only slept when I passed out from exhaustion .

945
01:09:39,510 --> 01:09:40,949
DOYLE : What about your Dad ?

946
01:09:41,270 --> 01:09:43,858
Didn 't he ever come back to at least check on you ?

947
01:09:44,310 --> 01:09:46,396
On the seventh day .

948
01:09:48,510 --> 01:09:50,157
( HATCH OPENING )

949
01:09:55,750 --> 01:09:57,973
Has God spoken to you yet ?

950
01:10:01,670 --> 01:10:03,714
There is no God .

951
01:10:18,470 --> 01:10:20,624
FENTON 'S VOICE : I lost count of the days after that .

952
01:10:21,430 --> 01:10:23,292
It felt like weeks .

953
01:10:23,870 --> 01:10:25,834
I finally went beyond fear

954
01:10:25,903 --> 01:10:28,132
into total insanity .

955
01:10:29,640 --> 01:10:31,574
I saw God .

956
01:10:32,149 --> 01:10:34,270
He had finally sent me a vision .

957
01:10:34,949 --> 01:10:36,904
It was then that I understood my destiny ,

958
01:10:36,980 --> 01:10:39,005
just like Dad said I would .

959
01:10:42,367 --> 01:10:44,653
ADAM : Dad , Fenton 's not answering .

960
01:10:44,749 --> 01:10:45,759
( DOOR OPENS )

961
01:10:47,029 --> 01:10:48,515
DAD : Fenton ?

962
01:10:48,825 --> 01:10:49,836
Fenton !

963
01:10:51,962 --> 01:10:53,862
( NAILS SQUEAKING )

964
01:11:02,149 --> 01:11:03,159
Fenton .

965
01:11:04,508 --> 01:11:05,518
Fenton ?

966
01:11:07,349 --> 01:11:09,535
Come on , kiddo .

967
01:11:10,549 --> 01:11:11,877
Get me that water .

968
01:11:14,189 --> 01:11:15,681
( FENTON WHIMPERING )

969
01:11:17,189 --> 01:11:20,546
Easy , boy . Easy , easy .

970
01:11:20,624 --> 01:11:22,523
Here you go , kiddo .

971
01:11:22,592 --> 01:11:24,617
There you go , buddy .

972
01:11:26,063 --> 01:11:27,469
Dad ?

973
01:11:28,469 --> 01:11:30,228
I saw God .

974
01:11:35,669 --> 01:11:37,698
Just try to take a little sip .

975
01:11:48,828 --> 01:11:50,108
Hey , slow down there .

976
01:11:50,295 --> 01:11:52,472
If you eat too fast , you 'll make yourself sick .

977
01:11:52,541 --> 01:11:54,600
ADAM : So did God tell you about the demons ?

978
01:11:56,068 --> 01:11:58,021
Sorry I ever doubted you , Dad .

979
01:11:59,395 --> 01:12:01,308
I 'm sorry too , son .

980
01:12:02,388 --> 01:12:03,862
What did God look like ?

981
01:12:04,108 --> 01:12:05,828
Kinda hard to describe .

982
01:12:06,047 --> 01:12:07,548
- Was he big ? - Adam .

983
01:12:08,571 --> 01:12:10,436
Let your brother eat in peace .

984
01:12:10,788 --> 01:12:12,303
He can 't explain something like that .

985
01:12:12,868 --> 01:12:13,948
But I want to know .

986
01:12:14,530 --> 01:12:17,242
- Then maybe you should pray for it . - It 's not fair !

987
01:12:17,311 --> 01:12:19,727
All I 've seen are demons and he gets to see God .

988
01:12:19,796 --> 01:12:20,868
That 's right .

989
01:12:21,768 --> 01:12:23,668
But look at the price he paid .

990
01:12:25,628 --> 01:12:27,508
That 's all behind us now .

991
01:12:28,336 --> 01:12:30,634
It 's a new day . Isn 't it , Fenton ?

992
01:12:31,127 --> 01:12:32,188
Mm-hmm .

993
01:12:32,344 --> 01:12:35,643
- We 're gonna go get us a demon now ? - After a while .

994
01:12:37,068 --> 01:12:38,890
When Fenton 's ready .

995
01:12:45,341 --> 01:12:47,358
FENTON 'S VOICE : A week later , I was ready .

996
01:12:49,245 --> 01:12:52,373
My first demon was to be Brad White from Dallas .

997
01:12:53,983 --> 01:12:57,110
- FENTON : There it is . - DAD : I see it .

998
01:13:15,467 --> 01:13:17,503
You sure you 're ready for this ?

999
01:13:18,187 --> 01:13:20,097
Yes , sir .

1000
01:13:24,947 --> 01:13:26,772
I bought these for you .

1001
01:13:26,848 --> 01:13:29,681
You 'll need them now that God has spoken to you .

1002
01:13:35,667 --> 01:13:37,781
- All right , let 's go . - ADAM : I want to go too , Dad .

1003
01:13:38,067 --> 01:13:39,656
Not this time , Adam .

1004
01:13:40,267 --> 01:13:42,252
You stay here and keep your eyes peeled .

1005
01:13:42,467 --> 01:13:45,197
Don 't worry , your time will come .

1006
01:13:48,667 --> 01:13:50,065
Let 's go .

1007
01:14:10,587 --> 01:14:12,351
( DOG BARKING )

1008
01:14:25,186 --> 01:14:26,196
Hey .

1009
01:14:26,786 --> 01:14:28,306
- Sorry to bother you . - Yeah .

1010
01:14:28,842 --> 01:14:31,037
My son and I , we had a flat on our van .

1011
01:14:32,986 --> 01:14:33,996
Huh , yeah ?

1012
01:14:34,214 --> 01:14:37,877
I was wondering if you had a tire iron , we left ours at home .

1013
01:14:38,706 --> 01:14:40,715
Hey , pal , what 's with the gloves ?

1014
01:14:40,906 --> 01:14:43,517
Oh , uh ... to change the tire .

1015
01:14:44,466 --> 01:14:46,057
- Don 't want to get your hands dirty . - Yeah .

1016
01:14:46,126 --> 01:14:48,117
WOMAN : Brad , who is it ?

1017
01:14:48,306 --> 01:14:50,823
Mind your business , you fucking bitch !

1018
01:14:53,200 --> 01:14:55,100
Goddamn women .

1019
01:14:56,506 --> 01:14:58,167
( CHUCKLES )

1020
01:14:58,626 --> 01:15:01,639
Yeah , I think I got one for you .

1021
01:15:02,706 --> 01:15:05,405
- Out back . - Great .

1022
01:15:10,106 --> 01:15:11,782
Back here .

1023
01:15:22,226 --> 01:15:23,236
Let 's see .

1024
01:15:24,364 --> 01:15:26,195
( TOOLS CLATTER )

1025
01:15:28,705 --> 01:15:29,715
Here it is .

1026
01:15:34,607 --> 01:15:36,336
Shit !

1027
01:15:36,409 --> 01:15:38,400
( GROANING )

1028
01:15:41,865 --> 01:15:43,378
Grab his legs .

1029
01:15:47,954 --> 01:15:49,683
( MATCH STRIKING )

1030
01:15:58,025 --> 01:15:59,521
( GROANS )

1031
01:16:13,225 --> 01:16:14,503
Brad White ?

1032
01:16:22,785 --> 01:16:24,219
You know , Fenton ,

1033
